20261027142641:********************************************************************************

20261027142641:*** START Inventory Transactions Extract Script
20261027142641:*** Loading configurations, and Inventory Transactions Query, Done.
20261027142641:*** RUNNING Inventory Transactions Data Extraction.

20261027142641:Query to get Data For Inventory Transactions:

SELECT a.ItemCode, a.Warehouse, a.Location, 
       STRFTIME('%m/%d/%Y', a.TransactionDate) AS TransactionDate,
       TIME(a.TransactionDate) AS TransactionTime,
       CAST(a.Quantity * b.Price *10000 AS INTEGER)/10000.0 AS TransactionAmount -- Same behavior as Oracle's TRUNC(x,4)
FROM InventoryTransactions a
  JOIN ItemPrices b
    ON a.ItemCode = b.ItemCode 
WHERE TransactionAmount > 0


